-- ============================================================================
-- FC8 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Metering, Control Valves & Storage,
-- intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE CONTROL VALVE AND ITS CHOKING BOUNDARY. The liquid
-- valve marched down its outlet pressure until it chokes; the allowable drop
-- and the critical pressure ratio factor that sets it; the cavitation index
-- computed on the drop the valve uses, its regime ladder and the refusal that
-- makes the ladder run at all; flashing as a different problem; the gas ratio
-- and the two thirds floor; the style table and the certified figure that
-- replaces it; authority and the characteristic it chooses; the noise screen
-- the stream power caps and floors; and a travel verdict over checks that ran.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. Past the boundary a larger coefficient buys
-- nothing, and a sizing on the stated drop undersizes the valve while looking
-- entirely reasonable. The capstone valve is CHOKED on purpose.
--
-- STATED SCREENS, taught and never graded: the cavitation thresholds, the
-- authority boundaries, the noise bands and the style table. The capstone
-- states its own certified FL, so no graded field reads the table, and it
-- grades the index and the authority as numbers and never the words laid over
-- them. The tier was audited question by question against the digest and the
-- engine before seeding (AUDIT-intermediate.md).
-- ============================================================================

